      "retrieved": [
        "taxonomy#0080",
        "taxonomy#0028",
        "taxonomy#0027",
        "taxonomy#0079",
        "csrd#0049"
      ],
      "answer": "The minimum safeguards must ensure alignment with the OECD Guidelines for Multinational Enterprises and the UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights [1]. They also cover the eight fundamental ILO conventions and the International Bill of Human Rights [1][2].",
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "input_tokens": 2255,
      "output_tokens": 198,
      "cost_usd": 0.0003245,
      "seconds": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q03",
      "retrieved": [
        "taxonomy#0077",
        "esrs#0743",
        "esrs#0198",
        "taxonomy#0061",
        "esrs#0234"
      ],
      "answer": "An economic activity is considered to significantly harm climate change mitigation where it leads to significant greenhouse gas emissions, taking into account the life cycle of its products and services [1].",
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "input_tokens": 2293,
      "output_tokens": 146,
      "cost_usd": 0.00030230000000000003,
      "seconds": 1.08
    },
    {
      "id": "q04",
      "retrieved": [
        "esrs#0088",
        "csrd#0069",
        "esrs#0037",
        "esrs#0087",
        "csrd#0051"
      ],
      "answer": "The passages do not state a \"two kinds\" requirement directly. Passage 5 says the information must cover relevant information from each materiality perspective and all sustainability matters [5]. Under the double materiality approach, those perspectives include impact materiality (negative and positive material impacts) and financial materiality (material risks and opportunities) [1][4].",
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "input_tokens": 2179,
      "output_tokens": 551,
      "cost_usd": 0.0004934,
      "seconds": 2.65
    },
    {
      "id": "q05",
      "retrieved": [
        "csrd#0244",
        "csrd#0018",
        "csrd#0243",
        "csrd#0246",
        "csrd#0247"
      ],
      "answer": "Large public-interest entities with more than 500 employees must report for financial years starting on or after 1 January 2024. [3]",
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "input_tokens": 2231,
      "output_tokens": 265,
      "cost_usd": 0.0003556,
      "seconds": 1.56
    },
    {
      "id": "q06",
      "retrieved": [
        "csrd#0214",
        "csrd#0086",
        "csrd#0087",
        "csrd#0215",
        "csrd#0221"
      ],
      "answer": "The Commission must adopt the delegated acts providing reasonable assurance standards no later than 1 October 2028 [1][3].",
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "input_tokens": 2179,
      "output_tokens": 43,
      "cost_usd": 0.00023940000000000002,
      "seconds": 0.79
    },
    {
      "id": "q07",
      "retrieved": [
        "csrd#0078",
        "csrd#0077",
        "csrd#0079",
        "csrd#0081",
        "esrs#0057"
      ],
      "answer": "Undertakings must prepare their management report in the electronic reporting format specified in Article 3 of Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2019/815 [1][2]. The ESRS sustainability statement must also be presented in a format that is both human-readable and machine-readable [5].",
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "input_tokens": 2108,
      "output_tokens": 279,
      "cost_usd": 0.0003503,
      "seconds": 1.49
    },
    {
      "id": "q08",
      "retrieved": [
        "esrs#0043",
        "esrs#0044",
        "esrs#0045",
        "esrs#0113",
        "esrs#0218"
      ],
      "answer": "The medium-term time horizon runs from the end of the short-term reporting period up to 5 years [2][1].",
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "input_tokens": 2151,
      "output_tokens": 36,
      "cost_usd": 0.00023310000000000003,
      "seconds": 0.74
    },
    {
      "id": "q09",
      "retrieved": [
        "esrs#0019",
        "esrs#0020",
        "esrs#0087",
        "esrs#0088",
        "esrs#0104"
      ],
      "answer": "Regardless of the materiality assessment outcome, the undertaking must always disclose all Disclosure Requirements and datapoints in ESRS 2 General Disclosures, plus the topical ESRS Disclosure Requirements (including datapoints) related to IRO-1, as listed in ESRS 2 Appendix C [1][2].",
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "input_tokens": 2332,
      "output_tokens": 251,
      "cost_usd": 0.00035870000000000005,
      "seconds": 1.49
    },
    {
