        "esrs#0220",
        "esrs#0191",
        "esrs#0187"
      ],
      "answer": "Disclosure Requirement E1-1 – Transition plan for climate change mitigation covers the undertaking's transition plan for climate change mitigation, as stated in paragraph 14 (\"The undertaking shall disclose its transition plan for climate change mitigation\") [4]. It is also listed under the Strategy heading in the passage [1].",
