        "csrd#0244",
        "csrd#0247"
      ],
      "answer": "Under the amended schedule, large undertakings that are not public-interest entities with over 500 employees (the non-listed group) must report for financial years starting on or after 1 January 2025, so the date is 2025 [4]. The passages set out this date but do not explicitly describe it as a postponement.",
